17:["$","h2","7",{"className":"mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-white","children":"What Is GST E-Invoicing?"}]
18:["$","p","8",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"GST e-invoicing is not a new invoice format for customers. It is a government reporting mechanism for selected GST invoices. Under this system, the supplier prepares the invoice in their billing or accounting software, converts the required details into the accepted data format, and reports it to the Invoice Registration Portal."}]]}]
19:["$","p","9",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"After the portal validates the information, it generates an Invoice Reference Number. The invoice also receives a signed QR code. This makes the invoice easier to verify and helps reduce mismatch between seller records, buyer records and GST reporting."}]]}]
1a:["$","p","10",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"In practical terms, e-invoicing connects your billing workflow with GST compliance. The fields you enter in your invoice matter more than ever. A casual invoice number, incomplete buyer GSTIN, wrong tax rate or mismatch between taxable value and GST amount can create avoidable problems."}]]}]
1b:["$","h2","11",{"className":"mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-white","children":"What Is IRN?"}]
1c:["$","p","12",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"IRN stands for Invoice Reference Number. It is a unique reference generated for an e-invoice after the invoice data is validated by the Invoice Registration Portal."}]]}]
1d:["$","p","13",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The IRN helps identify the invoice in the GST e-invoice system. It is not the same as your invoice number. Your invoice number is created by your business, for example INV-2026-001. The IRN is generated by the portal after submission."}]]}]
1e:["$","p","14",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Think of it like this:"}]]}]
1f:["$","div","15",{"className":"mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-white/10","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full min-w-[480px] text-left text-sm","children":["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","| Business field | Created by | Example purpose |",{"className":"border-b border-white/10 last:border-0","children":[["$","th","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-white","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Business field"}]]}],["$","th","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-white","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Created by"}]]}],["$","th","2",{"className":"px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-white","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Example purpose"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","| Invoice number | Your business | Internal billing, customer reference, accounting |",{"className":"border-b border-white/10 last:border-0","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Invoice number"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Your business"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Internal billing, customer reference, accounting"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","| IRN | E-invoice system | GST e-invoice validation and verification |",{"className":"border-b border-white/10 last:border-0","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"IRN"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"E-invoice system"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"GST e-invoice validation and verification"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","| QR code | E-invoice system | Machine-readable invoice verification |",{"className":"border-b border-white/10 last:border-0","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"QR code"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"E-invoice system"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Machine-readable invoice verification"}]]}]]}]]}]}]}]
20:["$","p","16",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"This is why invoice numbering discipline is still important. The portal does not replace your invoice numbering system. It validates the invoice data you submit."}]]}]
21:["$","h2","17",{"className":"mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-white","children":"What Is the Signed QR Code?"}]
22:["$","p","18",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The signed QR code is a machine-readable code returned as part of the e-invoice response. It contains important invoice details in a digitally signed form. Buyers, auditors, transport teams and compliance teams can use the QR code to verify key invoice information."}]]}]
23:["$","p","19",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The QR code is useful because it reduces dependency on only visual invoice layouts. Even if two invoice PDFs look different, the QR code helps identify the registered invoice data."}]]}]
24:["$","p","20",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Common details connected with the signed QR code may include supplier GSTIN, recipient GSTIN, invoice number, invoice date, invoice value and tax breakup. The exact technical structure should be checked with the official portal documentation."}]]}]
25:["$","h2","21",{"className":"mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-white","children":"Who Needs E-Invoicing in India?"}]
26:["$","p","22",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"E-invoicing applies to notified taxpayers under GST rules. Applicability has changed over time as the system expanded to more businesses. Many businesses remember earlier rollout thresholds, but you should not rely only on old blog posts or memory."}]]}]
27:["$","p","23",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Before making operational decisions, verify:"}]]}]
28:["$","ul","24",{"className":"mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-300","children":[["$","li","Current e-invoicing applicability on the official GST or e-invoice portal",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Current e-invoicing applicability on the official GST or e-invoice portal"}]]}],["$","li","Your aggregate turnover and GST registration status",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Your aggregate turnover and GST registration status"}]]}],["$","li","Type of supply and document",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Type of supply and document"}]]}],["$","li","Whether your business category has any exemption",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Whether your business category has any exemption"}]]}],["$","li","Your CA or GST consultant's advice",{"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Your CA or GST consultant's advice"}]]}]]}]
29:["$","p","25",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"This is especially important for growing businesses. A freelancer, agency or contractor may not need e-invoicing today, but if turnover grows or rules change, invoice data discipline becomes important quickly."}]]}]
2a:["$","h2","26",{"className":"mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-white","children":"How GST E-Invoicing Works"}]
2b:["$","p","27",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The exact software flow can differ, but the business process usually follows this pattern."}]]}]
2c:["$","h3","28",{"className":"mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-white","children":"1. Prepare the Invoice"}]
2d:["$","p","29",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Create a GST-ready invoice with complete supplier details, buyer details, invoice number, date, item rows, HSN or SAC, taxable value, GST rate and tax amounts. This is where most mistakes begin. If the base invoice is weak, the e-invoice workflow becomes harder."}]]}]
2e:["$","h3","30",{"className":"mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-white","children":"2. Convert Invoice Data Into the Required Format"}]
2f:["$","p","31",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"E-invoicing is data-driven. The portal needs structured invoice data, not just a pretty PDF. Your billing software, accounting software, API provider or portal utility may prepare the required data format."}]]}]
30:["$","h3","32",{"className":"mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-white","children":"3. Submit Data to the Invoice Registration Portal"}]
31:["$","p","33",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The invoice data is submitted to the IRP through an allowed route. Businesses may use software integrations, APIs or portal-supported methods depending on their setup and eligibility."}]]}]
32:["$","h3","34",{"className":"mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-white","children":"4. Portal Validates the Invoice"}]
33:["$","p","35",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The IRP checks whether required fields are present and whether the data is valid. Errors can happen when GSTIN is invalid, invoice number is duplicated, tax totals do not match, or mandatory fields are missing."}]]}]
34:["$","h3","36",{"className":"mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-white","children":"5. IRN and Signed QR Code Are Generated"}]
35:["$","p","37",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"If validation succeeds, the system returns the IRN and signed QR code. These become part of the final e-invoice record."}]]}]
36:["$","h3","38",{"className":"mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-white","children":"6. Share the Final Invoice"}]
37:["$","p","39",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The supplier can share the final invoice with the buyer as a PDF or printed copy, depending on business practice. The invoice should include the required GST details and e-invoice elements where applicable."}]]}]
38:["$","h2","40",{"className":"mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-white","children":"GST E-Invoice Data Checklist"}]
39:["$","p","41",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Before submitting invoice data, check these fields carefully."}]]}]
